{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the world of <i>Novath</i>, a turn-based tactical RPG adventure where your decisions determine your destiny. Train to become the greatest warrior in the land as three great nations teeter on the brink of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in classic, tactical turn-based battles with a party of your choosing. Each class has unique skills, strengths, and weaknesses to learn and exploit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/Description_SS.png?t=1748963570\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the Party You Believe In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subdue enemies through battle and force them to join your ranks\u2014or win over story-rich characters whose loyalty must be earned through choices and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/Description02_SS.png?t=1748963570\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Living World that Judges You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The continent of <i>Novath</i> simmers with history and unrest. Your choices\u2014who you slay, who you spare, and who you subjugate\u2014will shift how characters treat you, alter relationships, and open or close narrative paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/Description01_SS.png?t=1748963570\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995960?t=1748963570","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/b4ab9f3931a2eadf27f08a3bf5779407aaa16286/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748963570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/4e4b254